    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Alors qu\u2019il emm\u00e8ne sa femme \u00e0 la maternit\u00e9 pour accoucher, Thomas percute et tue un jeune homme sur la route. Marie-France, la m\u00e8re de ce dernier, ne parvient pas \u00e0 se remettre du drame. Neuf ans plus tard, Marie-France devient la secr\u00e9taire de Thomas sans qu\u2019il sache qui elle est. Peu \u00e0 peu, elle s\u2019immisce dangereusement dans sa vie et sa famille jusqu\u2019\u00e0 lui devenir indispensable.",
        "english": "While taking his wife to the hospital to give birth, Thomas knocks down and kills a young man on the road. Marie-France, the dead man's mother, has difficulty recovering from this dramatic event. Nine years later, Marie-France becomes Thomas' secretary, although he is oblivious to who she really is. Little by little she meddles dangerously with his life and his family until he can no longer do without her."
